source: tests/golden/harness.rs
---
  x `components/core/edited` tracks its library, and its content no longer
  | matches its lock entry
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-lock/components/components.lock.kdl:1:1]
 1 | component "core/edited" {
   : ^^^^|^^^^
   :     `-- this entry
 2 |     library "upstream"
   `----
  help: undo the edit to `components/core/edited`, or run `buildc set
        component core/edited --untracked` to make the copy the repository's
        own

  x `components/core/gone` tracks its library, and the directory is missing
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-lock/components/components.lock.kdl:8:1]
 7 | 
 8 | component "core/gone" {
   : ^^^^|^^^^
   :     `-- this entry
 9 |     library "upstream"
   `----
  help: restore `components/core/gone` from version control, or run `buildc
        fetch components core/gone` to copy it again

  x `broken-lock` declares an install layout, and nothing in the image
  | provides `bootc`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-lock/image.kdl:10:5]
  9 | 
 10 |     layout {
    :     ^^^|^^
    :        `-- a bootc-only node
 11 |         bootloader "grub2"
    `----
  help: an install layout describes how bootc installs the image: use a base
        that provides `bootc`, or drop `layout`
